    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d16">

                <pb facs="0023" n="13" sameAs="frus:frus1942China/pg13"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Generalissimo Chiang Kai-shek
                        </hi><anchor n="40" xml:id="d16-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-02-09">February 9,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We are rapidly increasing our ferry service to China via Africa and India. I can
                    now give you definite assurances that even though there should be a further
                    setback in Rangoon, which now seems improbable, the supply route to China via
                    India can be maintained by air.</p>
                <p>The whole plan seems altogether practical and I am sure we can make it a reality
                    in the near future.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
